msgstr "客户端"

msgid "Companies seeking other licensing terms can contact Vikrant Rathore."
msgstr "需要其他许可条款的企业可以联系 Vikrant Rathore。"

msgid "Configuring Sibuna with Jlavi"
msgstr "使用 Jlavi 配置 Sibuna"

msgid "Connections and datagrams."
msgstr "连接与数据报。"

