msgstr "学习它，使用它，质疑它。"

msgid "Legacy device"
msgstr "旧设备"

msgid "Load balancer design"
msgstr "负载均衡器设计（英文）"

msgid "Main"
msgstr "主导航"

msgid "Measured, with the losses"
msgstr "实测结果，包括落后之处"

msgid "Member States begin the transition."
msgstr "成员国启动迁移。"

msgid "Method and all measurements"
msgstr "方法与全部测量结果"

msgid "Next step"
msgstr "下一步"

msgid "Nodes of a mesh share the sticky table and the limits of a server, and forward a client to the node that owns it. A PostgreSQL database can publish one configuration to every node and roll it back."
msgstr "网格中的节点共享会话保持表和服务器的限制，并把客户端转发给拥有它的节点。PostgreSQL 数据库可以把同一份配置发布到每个节点，也可以回滚。"

msgid "November 2026"
msgstr "2026 年 11 月"

msgid "One process on the path"
msgstr "路径上只有一个进程"

msgid "Open source · LGPL 3.0 · {version}"
msgstr "开源 · LGPL 3.0 · {version}"

